# --- Room photo dataset ----------------------------------------------------
# The 141 original room JPEGs (~458 MB) live in the 14 room folders below.
# They are deliberately NOT tracked in git:
#   * size - they are 98% of the project by bytes;
#   * privacy - they are photographs of occupied tenant rooms.
# Every label, path and audit record for them is preserved in
# cleanliness_manifest.csv / .jsonl, and the derived features are committed
# under artifacts/embeddings/.
/A33*/
/A34*/
/B41*/
/C21*/
/C31*/

# --- External validation photos (A11/A12) ---------------------------------
# Same privacy and size rationale as the 141 photos above: these 27 JPEGs are
# photographs of occupied rooms. Their labels, paths and audit records live in
# artifacts/combined/combined_manifest_v2.csv.
/A11*/
/A12*/

# --- Rejected fine-tuning checkpoints -------------------------------------
# 7 x 90 MB ResNet-50 checkpoints from the LOPO fine-tuning run that was
# rejected for overfitting. Metrics are kept in artifacts/experiments_v2/.
/artifacts/models_v2/

# --- Review contact sheets ------------------------------------------------
# Montages that reproduce the room photographs themselves.
/artifacts/validation/review_sheets/
